OL,3,GNEWSABid to withhold MI5 information
OL,4,Afrom synagogue attack inquests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Government has applied to block
OL,7,Fsome MI5 information relating to the
OL,8,Ffatal Manchester synagogue attack from
OL,9,Fbeing heard in public, a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FA pre-inquest hearing at Manchester
OL,13,FCoroner's Court was told the Home
OL,14,FOffice wanted the information to be
OL,15,Fwithheld when the inquests into the
OL,16,Fdeaths of Adrian Daulby, 53, and Melvin
OL,17,FCravitz, 66, are held next year.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
