OL,3,GNEWSABid to withhold MI5 information
OL,4,Afrom synagogue attack inquests
OL,5,
OL,6,FJihad Al-Shamie, 35, a Syrian-born
OL,7,FBritish citizen, drove into the gates
OL,8,Fof the Heaton Park Hebrew Congregation
OL,9,FSynagogue in Manchester on 2 October
OL,10,Flast year.
OL,12,FHe then began attacking with a knife,
OL,13,Fwhile wearing a fake suicide belt.
